---
pagination:
    data: components
    size: 1
    alias: component
# The tag name IS the URL - no slugify. slugify() rewrites "_" to "-", which for the two
# readonly variants (et2-link-entry_ro, et2-vfs-name_ro) produced a URL naming a custom element
# that does not exist, and 404ed every link to them: the sidebar and component.njk's
# Related/Belongs-to/inherited-from links all use the raw tagName, as they should.
permalink: "components/{{component.tagName}}/"
layout: component.njk
---
